			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Leszek"
				],
				"points": [
					{
						"sceneId": 1204,
						"position": [
							18.814,
							1.291,
							12.133
						],
						"pointId": 142
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 1204,
						"position": [
							18.769,
							1.291,
							9.956
						],
						"pointId": 145
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 1204,
						"position": [
							18.758,
							1.291,
							10.74
						],
						"pointId": 146
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 760440201,
					"content": "Details on the targets are up on the board. I can fill you in if needed, but don't bother haggling over the bounties.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leszek"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440202,
					"content": "About the bounty targets...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440203,
					"content": "There are four targets on the board, but we only have leads for three. The first one's wanted for fraud...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leszek"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440204,
					"content": "...Stop, stop, stop! Save me the spiel for the brand new treasure hunters — I could reel it off as well as you. You know who I'm here about.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440205,
					"content": "The Curatorium wants to get involved?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leszek"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440206,
					"content": "That depends on how the Boss is feeling. Hmm, how did we arrive at you asking questions?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440207,
					"content": "Anyway, seems to me the real reason Crackjaw's not been found is the lack of leads. Look at the board. You haven't even said what he looks like.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440208,
					"content": "Well, if these treasure hunters set off without even knowing who they're looking for, well, they're hardly a match for someone like Hark. I don't want some novices wasting their time, much less throwing away their lives.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leszek"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440209,
					"content": "Fair point. Apart from the scar on his chin, what else can you tell me about him? Preferably something no one else knows?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440210,
					"content": "Something no one else knows... You're looking for physical characteristics? Like, say, if he had some marks on his back?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leszek"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440211,
					"content": "That's exactly what I'm looking for! But how do you know so much about him?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440212,
					"content": "I don't know squat. I never said he actually has any marks... Besides, even if he does, how are you going to see them?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leszek"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440213,
					"content": "W—Well, yeah, sorta... *sigh* So, there's nothing you can tell me? We've always worked well together — can't you give me anything to work with?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440214,
					"content": "After Hark revealed his true nature here in Nasha Town, he fled to the north of Lempo Isle and picked up his old life of crime.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leszek"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440215,
					"content": "That's old news. Everyone and their dog knows that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440216,
					"content": "No one's reported seeing him recently. What if he went further north? I could maybe track him to Piramida, but what if he's made it all the way to Snezhnograd?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440217,
					"content": "(Nothing but ice and snow up there. I'm not sure if my arm would function in the cold...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440218,
					"content": "He hasn't. He's still on Lempo Isle — I just don't know where. You can consider that \"something no one else knows.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leszek"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440219,
					"content": "Huh, how can you be so certain?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440220,
					"content": "Now that's a trade secret — you wanna know, you'll have to pay.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leszek"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440221,
					"content": "Hah, stingy! Still, a hulk of a man with a scar on his face... Even on Lempo Isle, they're not hard to find. How'm I supposed to know which one's Hark?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440222,
					"content": "Well, seeing as how we \"work together so well,\" I'll give you some free advice. Don't get too caught up in looking for a scar.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leszek"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440223,
					"content": "...Are you saying, he's found some way to hide the scar on his chin?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440224,
					"content": "I guess that makes sense. If everyone knows you as Crackjaw, walking around with no visible scar on your face would be a pretty good way to hide...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440225,
					"content": "In that case, I just need to find someone who's deliberately hiding their jawline, right? It's a lead, at least... Alright, if I find anything new, I'll come back and fill you in.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760440226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 760440226,
					"content": "I'll wait with baited breath...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Leszek"
				}
			]
		},
